  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/bathroom">Bathroom</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Amber Glass Apothecary Jars</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/bathroom/kuishi-amber-glass-apothecary-jars.png"
            alt="Amber glass apothecary jar by Kuishi styled in a warm bathroom interior by KASODI"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · BATHROOM & STORAGE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Amber Glass Apothecary Jars
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            Kuishi
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            Classic apothecary jars reimagined as beautiful everyday storage.
            Made from rich amber glass with traditional glass lids, they bring
            warmth and character to bathroom shelves, dressing tables and
            carefully styled displays.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Recycled Glass</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Sizes</span>
              <strong>50 · 100 · 250 · 500 · 1000 · 2000 ml</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Amber</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Origin</span>
              <strong>UK & Europe</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Style</span>
              <strong>Apothecary · Vintage-inspired</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Ideal for</span>
              <strong>Bath salts · Keepsakes · Display</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://tidd.ly/4gRs5aC"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            There is something timeless about traditional apothecary glass.
            The deep amber colour gives these jars a warm, collected feel,
            while the simple silhouette keeps them quietly elegant.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially love them grouped in different sizes on a bathroom
            shelf for bath salts and small essentials, on a dressing table,
            or simply styled as decorative glass objects. The amber tone works
            beautifully with natural stone, warm wood, linen and aged brass.
          </p>

          <p>
            Made with 45% recycled glass sourced from the UK and Europe,
            they also offer a thoughtful alternative to ordinary storage
            containers.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Made to be kept and used</h2>

        <p>
          Hand wash in warm, soapy water using a soft cloth or sponge.
          The glass is not dishwasher safe, so gentle hand washing is
          recommended to help preserve the finish over time.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Natural Stone</h3>
            <p>
              Travertine, marble and softly textured stone trays bring out the
              warmth of the amber glass and create a calm spa-like setting.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Soft Linen</h3>
            <p>
              Ivory, oatmeal and warm beige towels or linen add softness and
              keep the rich amber tone feeling relaxed rather than formal.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Aged Brass</h3>
            <p>
              Brushed or antique brass taps, trays and small accessories echo
              the warm undertones of the glass beautifully.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/bathroom/oiahomy-large-woven-rope-laundry-basket"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/bathroom/oiahomy-large-woven-rope-laundry-basket.png"
                alt="Large woven rope laundry basket"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>BATHROOM STORAGE</span>
              <h3>Large Woven Rope Laundry Basket</h3>
              <p>OIAHOMY</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
                alt="Boston Green Wine Glass"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Boston Green Wine Glass</h3>
              <p>Villeroy & Boch</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/botanical-vintage-pitcher"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-floral-ceramic-pitcher.png"
                alt="Botanical Vintage Pitcher"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME DECOR</span>
              <h3>Botanical Vintage Pitcher</h3>
              <p>Ethereal Eves</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          KUISHI · AMBER GLASS
        </p>

        <h2>
          Beautiful storage for the things you use every day.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://tidd.ly/4gRs5aC"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

